<div class="tit f_26">严正声明</div>
<div class="txt f_18">
<p style="line-height: 1.5;"><span style="color: #333333;"><strong style="outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&ldquo;蜜雪冰城&rdquo;未曾委托、授权或许可任何个人、网站、平台和公司以&ldquo;蜜雪冰城&rdquo;品牌的名义进行招商和加盟宣传，在中国与&ldquo;蜜雪冰城&rdquo;有关的信息请认准唯一官方网站：www.mxbc.com及唯一招商加盟热线:400-060-8888。</strong></span><br style="outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;" /><span style="color: #333333;"><strong style="outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&ldquo;蜜雪冰城&rdquo;</strong><span style="font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">为蜜雪冰城股份有限公司（以下简称&ldquo;我司&rdquo;）旗下的一个以经营新鲜冰淇淋&middot;茶饮为主的全球饮品连锁品牌，且我司是</span><strong style="outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">&ldquo;蜜雪冰城&rdquo;</strong><span style="font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">等相关商标的专有权利人。</span></span><br style="outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;" /><span style="color: #333333;"><span style="font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;近期，我司发现在互联网上出现了假冒</span><strong style="outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">&ldquo;蜜雪冰城&rdquo;</strong><span style="font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">品牌发布虚假招商信息、借机推销其他品牌等误导相关公众的微信公众号、微博账号、虚假网站等，严重损害了我司的合法权益。对此，我司特作出以下声明：</span></span><br style="outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;" /><span style="color: #333333;"><span style="font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1.我司旗下除运营</span><strong style="outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">&ldquo;蜜雪冰城&rdquo;</strong><span style="font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">品牌之外，只有&ldquo;幸运咖&rdquo;&ldquo;鲜啤福鹿家&rdquo;品牌。除此之外，任何与</span><strong style="outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">&ldquo;蜜雪冰城&rdquo;</strong><span style="font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">相似或在</span><strong style="outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">&ldquo;蜜雪冰城&rdquo;</strong><span style="font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">这四个字的基础上添加前后缀的假冒品牌或假借我司之名共同运营的其他品牌均与我司无关。</span></span><br style="outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;" /><span style="color: #333333;"><span style="font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2.蜜雪冰城唯一官方网站：www.mxbc.com及唯一招商加盟热线：400-060-8888。除此之外，我司未曾委托任何其他第三方快招网站、平台及公司对</span><strong style="outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">&ldquo;蜜雪冰城&rdquo;</strong><span style="font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">品牌进行招商宣传。</span></span><br style="outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;" /><span style="color: #333333; font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3.蜜雪冰城工作人员<strong>官方企业微信</strong>，认准双认证：蜜雪冰城的<strong>官方企业认证+工作人员实名认证。</strong></span><br style="outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;" /><span style="color: #333333;"><span style="font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 18px; background-color: #ffffff;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 希望广大消费者及加盟商客户提高警惕，理性判断各类消息，谨防上当受骗。对于仿冒者冒用</span><strong style="outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', Arial, 'Microsoft YaHei', -apple-system, BlinkMacSyste